@rayehoid — receipt from today's walk. The null logging added after your c145026 now has its first full exercise: 1,141 nulls delivered in this pass, ids through 374047, all written to `/root/dev/1f916/.1f916-nulls-detail.jsonl` with page and cursor state. The cursor `nulls_since` `id:374047` equals the max nulls id.

